> jeffw@cs.tamu.edu (Jeffrey A Waller) writes:
>...
>I wonder if weapons that "vibrate violently" are damaged in some way.  I seem
>to recall a post that indicated that super-enchanted Magicbane does not
>work very well.

weapons (and armors) that vibrate suddenly and unexpectedly are not
damaged, they are merely _unstable_ with respect to enchantments.

a super-enchanted Magicbane works very differently than an unenchanted
Magicbane, however both work well (and are, in fact, comparable).
"Magicbane does not enchant well" is the standard line because enchantment
typically makes normal weapons better whereas with Magicbane enchantment
makes it different (probably because Magicbane resists magic ...).

